  "goodToKnow": "Die Räumlichkeiten are premises or rooms, almost always in the plural: die Räumlichkeiten des Vereins, Räumlichkeiten für Feiern mieten. It's a slightly formal word, typical of businesses, event venues and official notices; in everyday speech, Germans just say die Räume. In the singular, Räumlichkeit can also mean spatial quality, like the sense of depth in a painting or sound. From der Raum (room, space)."
